{"id":"g02","question":"已退款的订单有多少","expect_tables":["orders"],"expect_values":["已退款"],"expect_nonempty":false,"notes":"字面变体回归：已退款/退款/已退"}
{"id":"g03","question":"那上个月呢","expect_tables":[],"expect_values":[],"notes":"多轮时间继承（M3 依赖前一轮 session_id）"}
